Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Run independent seeded defects and mutation tests to evaluate whether the suite detects meaningful violations. Remove redundant tests only when coverage remains, preserve regression cases for repaired bugs, and report uncovered requirements explicitly.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
